start    = 4294967265 (0xFFFFFFE1)
deadline =         19 (0x00000013)  [start + 50, modulo 2^32]
   ms  now(ticks)   naive  wrap-safe
    0  4294967265     yes         no
   10  4294967275     yes         no
   20  4294967285     yes         no
   30  4294967295     yes         no
   40           9      no         no
   50          19     yes        yes
   60          29     yes        yes
a 32-bit millisecond counter wraps every 2^32 ms = 49.71 days
